  >> 2. Recursive chunking
  >> 3. Semantic Chunking
  >> 4. Heirarchial Chunking (By maintaining sections)
  >> 5. Document aware Chunking
  >> Hybrid Chunking
  >> Multi model chunking (text, video, audio)

