🔹 Vector Search
   >> In vector search it converts words(test) into numbers
     [All Is well]   --> embedding technique ----> [0.8, 0.5, 0.1]

🔹 Vector Database
   >>  🎯 Storage
      >> Ex : A customer ticket info needs to be stored in vector database
         Ticket details ---> embedding model ---> vector [0.8, 0.5, 0.1] + Meta data (Customer ID, Prodcut category, Type, content ..etc)
   >>  🎯 Similarity Search
         While searching, it uses simantic search to match to vector
        >> 🔹 Indexing :To make search simpler Vector database used Indexing (Appropriate nearest neighbour search (ANN))
        >> 🔹 Indexing Techniques:
             1. 🔹 HNSW (Heairarchial Navigable Small world)
             2. 🔹 IVF (Clustering)
             3. 🔹 PQ  
